OL,3,GNEWSAClaudia and Alison Hammond get the
OL,4,Acake treatment at major show
OL,5,
OL,6,FClaudia Winkleman and Alison Hammond
OL,7,Fare among the celebrities who have been
OL,8,Fgiven the cake treatment - lining up
OL,9,Falongside the Prince and Princess of
OL,10,FWales at one of the baking industry's
OL,11,Fbiggest events.
OL,13,FA host of spectacular creations are on
OL,14,Fdisplay at Cake International at
OL,15,FBirmingham's NEC, which got under way
OL,16,Fearlier.
OL,18,FFrom lifelike every day items such as
OL,19,Fhandbags and sandwiches to elaborate
OL,20,Fedible sculptures, bakers and cake
OL,21,Fartists have pulled out all the stops
OL,22,Ffor this year's event.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
