OL,3,GNEWSAClaudia and Alison Hammond get the
OL,4,Acake treatment at major show
OL,5,
OL,6,FEstablished in 1994, Cake International
OL,7,Fattracts cake artists, bakers and
OL,8,Fchocolatiers from around the globe and
OL,9,Fis expected to welcome about 25,000
OL,10,Fvisitors over three days.
